<title>USA: Owosso Q4 Oct 27 shr net loss.</title>
<headline>Owosso Q4 Oct 27 shr net loss.</headline>
<dateline>KING OF PRUSSIA, Pa. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr   loss		 $0.20   profit	 $0.22</p>
<p> Net   loss		 1,161   profit	 1,291</p>
<p> Sales		     33,559		   30,139</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,762		    5,865</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr   loss		 $0.03   profit	 $1.09</p>
<p> Net   loss		   177   profit	 6,383</p>
<p> Sales		    128,216		  108,001</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,839		    5,865</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Owosso Corp</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said the reduction in net income in the full year was due to reduced sales and margins in Owosso's historical businesses, increased corporate and interest expenses, a higher effective tax rate and its inventory reduction program. In the fourth quarter 1996 the net loss was mostly due to the inventory reduction program, year-end adjustments and lower income from operations at companies included in both years, Owosso said.</p>
</text>
